{"text": "Snowflakes fell on her long golden hair, but she did not think about that. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lights were shining from all the windows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a wonderful smell of roast goose in the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is New Years Eve, she thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She sat down in a corner between two houses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She pulled her little feet under her, but she felt colder and colder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She did not want to go home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had not sold any matches, so her father would be angry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her home was cold too, because the wind blew through big cracks in the roof. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her little hands were almost frozen with cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Perhaps one little match could warm her fingers.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "n", "o", "w", "f", "l", "a", "k", "e", "s", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", " ", "g", "o", "l", "d", "e", "n", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "g", "h", "t", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "h", "i", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "w", "o", "n", "d", "e", "r", "f", "u", "l", " ", "s", "m", "e", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "r", "o", "a", "s", "t", " ", "g", "o", "o", "s", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ",